ame": "Screenshot_4.png", "id": "1618890945990623", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1618890949323956_3024335625540032953_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KmmdLTz7-SEQ7kNvwF2KdeH&_nc_oc=Adq80vmwGGYfYXr_amJBhwVunwmqSInHz_3BtNcRP7dId9jaKQc2ixw6cEn-ydD02qE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af--2_bd59_sfgKtSrcfhbYXL4j6dW35TxdYXsHUKaKy_g&oe=6A300F13"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "1637896580588771", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491829120_1637896583922104_7013316613147983055_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bVh9yFGLCmwQ7kNvwE9VOMz&_nc_oc=AdqYG7oATEyVRS6rhNkaYpSZHLtxru5uGml-8sbao4O1l22CnuGVhIQv9Cti5rA8KrY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-RQT_75Rh-cUjVWiS2mtVDk2-UKQDADkicE6hFsGyirQ&oe=6A30189E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Scuba Diving Underwater Adventure", "keywords": ["ScubaDiving", "UnderwaterAdventure", "DivingGame", "UnderwaterSimulator", "OceanExploration"], "long_description": "Dive into an exciting scuba diving underwater adventure \ud83c\udf0a and explore the wonders hidden beneath the ocean\u2019s surface. Swim through colorful coral reefs \ud83d\udc20, glide alongside vibrant fish, and uncover treasures tucked away in the deep blue. This immersive ocean exploration game lets you experience breathtaking underwater landscapes, from glowing reefs to mysterious shipwrecks \u2693, all designed with smooth and realistic diving mechanics for a truly engaging journey.\n\nTake on the role of a skilled scuba diver \ud83e\udd3f, complete a variety of fun and challenging missions, and discover rare marine life along the way. Each dive brings new surprises, encouraging you to explore further and interact with fascinating sea creatures like turtles \ud83d\udc22, exotic fish, and more. Capture stunning underwater moments \ud83d\udcf8 and build your collection as you progress through this relaxing yet adventurous experience.\n\nFeatures:\n\ud83d\udc20 Swim and explore a vibrant underwater world\n\ud83c\udf0a Enjoy a realistic scuba diving experience\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Discover hidden treasures and secret locations\n\ud83d\udc1f Interact with diverse marine life\n\ud83c\udfae Complete engaging missions and challenges\n\ud83d\udcf8 Capture beautiful underwater scenes\n\nWhether you enjoy casual exploration or deep-sea adventures, this game offers endless opportunities for discovery and fun beneath the waves \ud83c\udf1f", "short_description": "Dive into the mysterious depths of the ocean \ud83c\udf0a in this exciting scuba diving adventure! Explore vibrant coral reefs \ud83d\udc20, discover hidden treasures \ud83d\udc8e, and encounter fascinating marine life in a rich underwater world. Swim through stunning environments, complete engaging missions, and experience the beauty of the deep sea \ud83d\udc19. With immersive visuals and smooth controls, every dive feels alive and full of wonder. \ud83c\udf1f"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhub-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Horizon Hub", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhubcom/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "zh_HK", "zh_TW", "ja", "de", "fr", "it", "ko", "pt", "es", "th", "tr", "ru"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"